; error: 13:23: 'Point.made' is given as 'a' too, and the call changes it through 'b'; a place the call changes is given once, so keep a copy of it in a variable first, and give that as the other
shape Point
    shared flex made: int = 0
fi

task swap(flex& a: int, flex& b: int)
    fixed t = a
    a = b
    b = t
fi

task main()
    swap(&Point.made, &Point.made)
fi
